aenc:IntegerValueShape skos:definition "Applied through references from other shapes. An integer value is a literal of an XSD integer-family datatype (xsd:integer, xsd:positiveInteger, xsd:nonNegativeInteger, xsd:int, xsd:long, xsd:unsignedInt, xsd:unsignedLong, xsd:short, xsd:unsignedShort, xsd:byte or xsd:unsignedByte). A conforming value is an integer (of any XSD integer datatype)."@en .
aenc:RangeDatatypeShape skos:definition "Applies to subjects using aenc:bitrate. aenc:bitrate takes a positive integer (rdfs:range xsd:positiveInteger)."@en .
